r-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학생신청 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: <b>2026.8.12.(</b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) 09:00 ~ 9.9.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">까지</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: <b>2026-2</b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">동계방학 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">국가근로장학사업 참여 희망 학생</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">한국장학재단 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(www.kosaf.go.kr) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">및 모바일 어플을 이용하여 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">첨부파일 매뉴얼 참조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">희망근로기관 신청 및 선발 일정은 학교 홈페이지 공고 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:17.9pt;text-indent:-17.9pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; ※ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">차 신청자 중 학교 희망근로지 신청 마감 이전 학자금 구간 산정 완료 시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 학기중 국가근로 참여 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">국가근로장학금은 소속대학이 확정된 학생만 신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">편</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">입생은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">차 학생신청기간 이용</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -11.4pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- 2026</span><span style=\"text-indent: -11.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년도 동계방학 집중근로 프로그램에 참여하고자 하는 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -11.4pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -11.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">반드시 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -11.4pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2</span><span style=\"text-indent: -11.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 학생신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -11.4pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(1</span><span style=\"text-indent: -11.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">차 또는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -11.4pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2</span><span style=\"text-indent: -11.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">차</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -11.4pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"text-indent: -11.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">에 국가근로장학금 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">사정 및 일정에 따라 변경 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">국가근로장학사업 관련 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: 1599-2290</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">붙임 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2026</span><